node_modules/
status.json
_site/
package.json
package-lock.json
shots/
# scratch a session writes at the repo root because playwright-core resolves from here.
# *.png at the root only — the game's real icons live in subdirectories and at named paths,
# and screenshots taken to answer a question must never be committed as if they were art.
*.tmp.js
/*.png
!/icon-*.png
# A screenshot script whose output directory came from an unset variable writes to
# ./undefined/ at the repo root. It happened 2026-09-09; the cure for the mistake is not
# committing it, but this stops the next one reaching a commit at all.
/undefined/
